1
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,120
I dreamed of Yanyan last night.

2
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,000
When she first joined the R&D Department,

3
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,439
she was so happy.

4
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,479
If they hadn't gone too far,

5
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:46,439
she never would have taken her own life.

6
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:48,000
Yanyan is gone,

7
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:51,360
and her dad followed her.

8
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,479
My happy family

9
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,319
was torn apart just like that.

10
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,800
I refuse to accept this.

11
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,639
Even if I have to risk these old bones of mine,

12
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:06,120
I will get justice for Yanyan.

13
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:25,400
Chu Yan's blood won't be shed in vain.

14
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,560
Those who hurt her

15
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:30,639
will all pay the price.

16
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,039
The fire must burn fiercely

17
00:03:43,439 --> 00:03:45,479
for those scumbags to tell

18
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,639
whether the ashes in the fire are bone

19
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:52,560
or paper.

20
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:07,240
Why are you here?

21
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,919
Grandma.

22
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:13,120
Luo Luo, you're here.

23
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:13,719
Come, come, come.

24
00:04:13,719 --> 00:04:14,879
Come here quickly.

25
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:15,479
Come.

26
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,040
Sit next to Grandma.

27
00:04:18,319 --> 00:04:19,399
You're wearing so little.

28
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:19,839
Aren't you

29
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,759
going to catch a cold?

30
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:22,920
No.

31
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:23,680
Grandma.

32
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,319
Hurry up and

33
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:27,800
pour Luo Luo some hot tea.

34
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,720
Are you thirsty?

35
00:04:30,879 --> 00:04:31,879
Are you hungry?

36
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,079
I'm not, Grandma.

37
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:35,040
These earrings are so pretty.

38
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,519
The color suits you too.

39
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:37,800
I'll give them to you.

40
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:40,000
They look better on you, Grandma.

41
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,040
Grandma

42
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:45,639
is so happy to see you.

43
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,120
Auntie Lin's bump...

44
00:04:48,319 --> 00:04:49,680
It's been over two months, right?

45
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:52,319
And she hasn't had morning sickness once.

46
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,279
I wonder

47
00:04:54,439 --> 00:04:55,639
if this well-behaved baby

48
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:57,519
is a little brother or sister.

49
00:04:59,079 --> 00:04:59,920
That's right.

50
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:01,800
It's been long enough.

51
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:04,399
We should be able to know the gender.

52
00:05:04,879 --> 00:05:06,800
Go to the hospital for a checkup tomorrow.

53
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,680
It would be best

54
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,480
if you gave Feng a son.

55
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,639
Just imagine,

56
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,199
if your father's spirit in heaven

57
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,920
saw you have both a son and a daughter,

58
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,560
how happy he would be.

59
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:17,160
Yes, Grandma. Mom,

60
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:19,399
the baby is still too small.

61
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:21,199
We can only test the gender via blood test.

62
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,920
I'm afraid it's bad for the baby.

63
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,240
Drawing your blood...

64
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:26,000
What does that have to do with the baby?

65
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,160
Isn't that right?

66
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,079
Grandma's right, isn't she?

67
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:34,439
Auntie Hong,

68
00:05:34,959 --> 00:05:35,959
help Sister-in-law back to her room.

69
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,399
Mom,

70
00:05:43,800 --> 00:05:45,160
the baby is still too small.

71
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:46,120
Let's wait a bit longer.

72
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,480
An ultrasound later is safer.

73
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,639
This is women's business.

74
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:50,079
Why are you butting in?

75
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,920
Since it's a child of the Cheng family,

76
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,439
I won't just sit idly by.

77
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:56,279
Sister-in-law is weak.

78
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,040
You wouldn't want to see Big Brother's child

79
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,120
come to any harm, would you?

80
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:07,959
Hold on.

81
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,680
You promised me

82
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:15,759
you wouldn't target Lin Wanmei anymore.

83
00:06:16,839 --> 00:06:18,160
I just wanted to

84
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,920
get my future little brother or sister

85
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:21,240
some gifts in advance.

86
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:22,639
Knowing the gender

87
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:25,079
makes it easier to buy clothes and toys.

88
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,360
Is there a problem with that?

89
00:06:30,319 --> 00:06:31,120
Help!

90
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,560
Little Uncle is going to hit me!

91
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,399
Auntie Hong.

92
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:09,879
Auntie Hong.

93
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,399
Is your hand okay?

94
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:15,319
I was just too impulsive.

95
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,720
But I really couldn't take it anymore.

96
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,079
I completely understand.

97
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,839
But Auntie Hong,

98
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,519
before a storm hits,

99
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:25,000
the sea is always exceptionally calm.

100
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:26,720
We have to endure this.

101
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,600
We can't be impulsive anymore.

102
00:07:34,279 --> 00:07:36,199
I gathered everyone here today

103
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,800
to discuss the red wines we recently developed

104
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:40,360
and conduct an in-depth analysis.

105
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:42,360
Because every single wine here

106
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:44,439
actually contains everyone's hard work and dedication.

107
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:57,240
This wine has a really good flavor.

108
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,839
But

109
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,879
I think the fermentation time

110
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:02,680
was just a little bit too short.

111
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,480
If it were a bit longer,

112
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,759
its woody aroma

113
00:08:05,759 --> 00:08:07,079
would be much richer.

114
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:08,360
Here.

115
00:08:08,439 --> 00:08:09,199
The second batch.

116
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:20,600
Who brought out Chu Yan's cursed wine?

117
00:08:20,839 --> 00:08:22,199
H-Hurry up and throw it away!

118
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:26,600
This is Chu Yan's life's work!

119
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,439
You can't throw it away!

120
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,600
Zhao Yue,

121
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,519
why play the good guy now?

122
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,519
Hurry up and throw it away!

123
00:08:31,519 --> 00:08:32,799
Get it out of my sight!

124
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:45,720
Supervisor Xiao.

125
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,200
Didn't you get enough of a beating last time?

126
00:08:48,879 --> 00:08:50,879
Zhao Yue is now part of my Innovation Team.

127
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,399
It's not your place to give orders here.

128
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:55,799
Director Sang,

129
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,200
you're new here

130
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,279
and don't know the situation.

131
00:08:58,279 --> 00:08:59,600
I'm kindly reminding you,

132
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:02,120
this Zhao Yue,

133
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,480
just like that Chu Yan,

134
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,799
is a burden who only causes trouble.

135
00:09:05,919 --> 00:09:07,720
If you really want to protect this burden,

136
00:09:07,879 --> 00:09:08,879
I won't stop you.

137
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:11,039
If she causes any trouble later on,

138
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,759
even if you're part of the Cheng family,

139
00:09:12,960 --> 00:09:14,600
you won't be able to bear the responsibility.

140
00:09:16,919 --> 00:09:19,039
So you do know I'm part of the Cheng family!

141
00:09:19,799 --> 00:09:21,399
Then listen to me carefully.

142
00:09:22,159 --> 00:09:24,320
Zhao Yue answers to me now.

143
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,399
If anything happens,

144
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,799
I will take full responsibility.

145
00:09:28,759 --> 00:09:29,879
Understood?

146
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:31,879
Since you've given your word, Director Sang,

147
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:33,000
I can rest easy.

148
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:34,879
Zhao Yue,

149
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:37,879
don't let down Director Sang's expectations.

150
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:14,519
Don't touch me.

151
00:10:14,759 --> 00:10:15,399
It's me.

152
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:16,120
Zhao Yue.

153
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,320
Calm down.

154
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,840
I'll help you.

155
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,879
Were you close to Chu Yan?

156
00:10:26,639 --> 00:10:27,759
I can tell.

157
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,519
You really care about what happened to her.

158
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:31,639
Chu Yan.

159
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:35,080
She...

160
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,600
It's all my fault.

161
00:10:41,759 --> 00:10:43,159
It's all my fault.

162
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:48,440
If only I had stood up for her back then,

163
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:50,080
Chu Yan wouldn't have died.

164
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:52,679
Chu Yan wouldn't have died.

165
00:10:52,679 --> 00:10:53,639
I know, I know.

166
00:10:53,639 --> 00:10:54,720
Just calm down first.

167
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,320
Listen to me.

168
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,440
Don't put this all on yourself.

169
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,039
It's not your fault, okay?

170
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,480
It's all my fault.

171
00:11:03,519 --> 00:11:05,279
It's all my fault.

172
00:11:07,399 --> 00:11:08,600
I knew perfectly well.

173
00:11:08,759 --> 00:11:09,720
I knew perfectly well what she

174
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:11,679
was going through,

175
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,440
but I didn't dare step up to help her.

176
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,320
Zhao Yue.

177
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,080
Zhao Yue.

178
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:18,799
Zhao Yue.

179
00:11:18,799 --> 00:11:20,799
I'm just a coward.

180
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,720
I failed her.

181
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,120
I failed her.

182
00:11:28,519 --> 00:11:29,320
Zhao Yue.

183
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,759
Zhao Yue.

184
00:11:49,759 --> 00:11:51,360
I let you down.

185
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:10,399
Zhao Yue.

186
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,679
Do you want to end up like Chu Yan,

187
00:12:15,919 --> 00:12:18,080
losing your life for nothing over those scumbags?

188
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,799
Chu Yan.

189
00:12:33,039 --> 00:12:35,480
Chu Yan was killed by bad guys.

190
00:12:36,919 --> 00:12:38,440
She was so scared.

191
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,360
She kept begging me to save her.

192
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:07,559
Supervisor Xiao!

193
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:08,759
Supervisor Xiao!

194
00:13:09,159 --> 00:13:10,519
Supervisor Xiao, take good care of your clients.

195
00:13:10,519 --> 00:13:11,399
Open the door!

196
00:13:11,559 --> 00:13:13,159
You'll be well rewarded.

197
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:14,159
Supervisor Xiao!

198
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:20,440
Hello?

199
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,799
Hello? Zhao Yue!

200
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,960
Zhao Yue, come save me!

201
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,919
I don't want to do this.

202
00:13:28,159 --> 00:13:29,279
Stay away!

203
00:13:29,279 --> 00:13:30,039
No!

204
00:13:30,039 --> 00:13:31,240
Let go of me!

205
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:31,799
Baby.

206
00:13:31,799 --> 00:13:32,799
Somebody!

207
00:13:32,799 --> 00:13:33,399
Be a good girl.

208
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:34,240
Help!

209
00:13:34,919 --> 00:13:35,840
Help me!

210
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:36,720
Hurry up!

211
00:13:42,039 --> 00:13:44,000
The innocent die bearing injustice,

212
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:47,919
while the wicked roam free.

213
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,559
This cycle of karma

214
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:52,120
brings such despair.

215
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:57,639
But we still have one chance to make amends.

216
00:13:58,879 --> 00:14:01,480
At least let Chu Yan leave with a clean name.

217
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,519
Yeah.

218
00:14:06,120 --> 00:14:07,399
Besides this recording,

219
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:09,240
did you find anything else?

220
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:16,759
Brother Yan.

221
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,960
When are you finally going to promote me?

222
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,759
Before, I was suppressed by Lin Wanmei.

223
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,320
Now there's Sang Luo.

224
00:14:22,559 --> 00:14:23,759
In the R&D Center,

225
00:14:23,759 --> 00:14:25,440
I'll never get ahead.

226
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,320
That bastard Lin Wanmei!

227
00:14:29,720 --> 00:14:31,120
She set me up.

228
00:14:33,399 --> 00:14:34,639
Help me think.

229
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,879
Is there really no dirt on her?

230
00:14:38,039 --> 00:14:38,840
Brother Yan.

231
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:41,399
Lin Wanmei has always been very careful.

232
00:14:41,559 --> 00:14:43,240
I've been by her side for so long,

233
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:45,720
and I really haven't found any dirt on her.

234
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,159
As long as you

235
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:53,279
help me bring Lin Wanmei down,

236
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:58,000
I will surely

237
00:14:58,759 --> 00:15:00,679
soar straight up

238
00:15:02,039 --> 00:15:03,440
three

239
00:15:03,679 --> 00:15:05,559
thousand

240
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:09,879
feet.

241
00:15:19,919 --> 00:15:21,440
Today is the anniversary of Chu Yan's death.

242
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,519
Her ghost has come back for me.

243
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,039
There's a figure.

244
00:15:28,679 --> 00:15:29,559
A figure?

245
00:15:36,639 --> 00:15:38,519
There are no ghosts here.

246
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:45,480
What the hell!

247
00:15:58,039 --> 00:15:58,840
Zhao Yue.

248
00:16:00,559 --> 00:16:01,360
Come here.

249
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,000
Supervisor Xiao.

250
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:08,399
Why keep your head down?

251
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:12,639
You're a big shot in the R&D Department now.

252
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,080
Supervisor Xiao...

253
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,759
Do you need something?

254
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:18,559
Just say the word.

255
00:16:20,279 --> 00:16:21,759
Don't think siding with Sang Luo

256
00:16:21,759 --> 00:16:23,559
means you can rest easy.

257
00:16:24,159 --> 00:16:25,360
Watch out, or you and your master

258
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,799
will go down together.

259
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,200
Supervisor Xiao,

260
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:29,519
I...

261
00:16:29,639 --> 00:16:30,840
I wouldn't dare.

262
00:16:31,759 --> 00:16:32,559
Get lost!

263
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:37,399
Stop staring.

264
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:58,519
What's going on?

265
00:16:58,519 --> 00:16:58,840
Let's go.

266
00:16:58,879 --> 00:17:00,039
Why are you leaving so suddenly?

267
00:17:02,639 --> 00:17:03,519
Are you all deaf?

268
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:06,079
Supervisor Xiao.

269
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,680
The winery hasn't been peaceful lately.

270
00:17:07,759 --> 00:17:09,160
Bad things happen after ten.

271
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,119
What things?

272
00:17:10,119 --> 00:17:11,200
You'd better explain yourself.

273
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:13,880
There's something unholy in the R&D lab lately.

274
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:15,480
It's almost time.

275
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:16,680
Stop talking nonsense.

276
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,920
This is caused by unstable voltage.

277
00:17:21,279 --> 00:17:22,200
Sister Chu Yan!

278
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:23,799
I've only been here for three months.

279
00:17:23,799 --> 00:17:25,000
Don't come looking for me.

280
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:26,000
Seek revenge on the one who wronged you.

281
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,000
Don't come after me!

282
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:35,279
The wine for the New Product Launch isn't ready yet.

283
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,640
If anyone dares to leave,

284
00:17:37,279 --> 00:17:38,920
don't even think about returning to Gufeng Group.

285
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,599
Don't you understand me?

286
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,000
Why are you so slow to react every time?

287
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:54,119
Supervisor Xiao.

288
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,960
I need to go to the wine cellar.

289
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:57,559
Director Sang

290
00:17:57,599 --> 00:17:59,200
specifically instructed today

291
00:17:59,319 --> 00:18:01,240
to keep the red wine fermenting at a low temperature.

292
00:18:01,759 --> 00:18:02,839
Keep it

293
00:18:03,279 --> 00:18:05,000
at the lowest temperature.

294
00:18:06,519 --> 00:18:07,759
Just go back and stay put.

295
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:09,799
Such a minor task,

296
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,759
just leave it to me.

297
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,160
Everyone get back to work.

298
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:25,839
You dare go against me?

299
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:28,079
Watch me turn your wine up to the highest temperature

300
00:18:28,319 --> 00:18:29,599
and ruin your wine.

301
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,119
Morning!

302
00:18:43,119 --> 00:18:44,000
Little Sunny.

303
00:18:47,079 --> 00:18:48,000
Supervisor Xiao.

304
00:18:48,519 --> 00:18:50,039
Gufeng Group is a big company.

305
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:51,680
Hanging an ugly thing like this,

306
00:18:51,799 --> 00:18:52,720
if clients see it,

307
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:54,519
it will affect the company's image.

308
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,319
I understand.

309
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:56,119
Supervisor Xiao.

310
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:56,960
But this was

311
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:58,599
handmade by my mom.

312
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,319
Your mom?

313
00:19:05,359 --> 00:19:06,759
My aim isn't very good.

314
00:19:07,799 --> 00:19:09,319
But an ugly thing like this

315
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:11,359
belongs in the trash.

316
00:19:28,519 --> 00:19:29,440
Impossible.

317
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:40,960
Dolls all look the same.

318
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,680
It can't be Chu Yan's.

319
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,160
Supervisor Xiao.

320
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:52,359
Can I have my doll back now?

321
00:19:54,799 --> 00:19:55,839
Help!

322
00:19:56,359 --> 00:19:57,160
There's a ghost!

323
00:20:00,960 --> 00:20:01,759
A ghost!

324
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:02,359
Over there!

325
00:20:02,359 --> 00:20:03,240
There's a ghost over there!

326
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:04,480
What ghost?

327
00:20:04,519 --> 00:20:06,039
She's come to take my life!

328
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,400
It's Chu Yan!

329
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,400
Looks like Gufeng Group really is haunted.

330
00:20:11,559 --> 00:20:13,279
Even Supervisor Xiao saw a ghost.

331
00:20:15,519 --> 00:20:16,480
Whether it's a human or a ghost,

332
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,640
we'll know once we take a look.

333
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:47,680
What's so urgent?

334
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,039
Master.

335
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,480
Please save me.

336
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,920
Chu Yan is coming for revenge.

337
00:20:56,079 --> 00:20:57,119
Just the slightest sign of trouble

338
00:20:57,119 --> 00:20:58,440
scares you like this.

339
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,559
I've already spoken to security.

340
00:21:00,559 --> 00:21:02,119
They'll send me the surveillance footage.

341
00:21:02,359 --> 00:21:03,519
I want to see for myself

342
00:21:03,599 --> 00:21:05,119
who's playing these tricks.

343
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,039
But...

344
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:09,079
what if...

345
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,640
it really is Chu Yan's ghost?

346
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:14,640
Ghost stories are just made up.

347
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:43,440
See for yourself.

348
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,279
I swear I saw her.

349
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:53,119
Right...

350
00:21:53,279 --> 00:21:54,480
Right here.

351
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,519
It's her.

352
00:21:58,799 --> 00:21:59,880
She's coming back for my life.

353
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:00,640
Master.

354
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:01,880
Back then,

355
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:04,119
I just did exactly as you ordered.

356
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,160
Chu Yan's death...

357
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,319
You can't blame it all on me.

358
00:22:06,319 --> 00:22:07,480
Keep your voice down.

359
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:14,839
When Chu Yan was alive, she was easily manipulated.

360
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,519
What trouble can she cause now that she's dead?

361
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,920
I killed her once,

362
00:22:19,279 --> 00:22:21,799
and I can destroy her completely a second time.

363
00:22:24,079 --> 00:22:26,079
Our main concern right now isn't Chu Yan.

364
00:22:26,319 --> 00:22:27,839
It's that bitch, Sang Luo.

365
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:29,599
She opposes me at every turn.

366
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:32,799
I told you to keep an eye on her at the company.

367
00:22:32,799 --> 00:22:33,680
How is that going?

368
00:22:38,519 --> 00:22:40,599
The company has a new product launching.

369
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:41,880
Sang Luo

370
00:22:42,079 --> 00:22:43,920
is setting up some livestream sale.

371
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,200
She's making a huge deal out of it.

372
00:22:49,839 --> 00:22:51,359
A livestream, huh?

373
00:22:57,319 --> 00:22:58,160
Director Sang,

374
00:22:58,200 --> 00:22:59,759
here is the schedule for tomorrow's

375
00:22:59,759 --> 00:23:00,599
livestream interactive segment.

376
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,559
Please review it.

377
00:23:02,359 --> 00:23:03,920
Shorten the formal segment by five minutes,

378
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:05,960
and put that time into the product showcase.

379
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:06,960
That's our real highlight.

380
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:07,319
Got it.

381
00:23:07,319 --> 00:23:08,000
Okay.

382
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:08,799
Director Sang,

383
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:10,960
this is the final plan for the livestream background.

384
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:11,960
Please confirm it.

385
00:23:12,160 --> 00:23:12,960
Darken the background.

386
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:13,759
Enlarge the logo,

387
00:23:13,759 --> 00:23:14,319
and move it to the center.

388
00:23:14,319 --> 00:23:14,799
Okay.

389
00:23:15,119 --> 00:23:15,599
Will do.

390
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:19,039
Alright,

391
00:23:19,119 --> 00:23:20,160
everyone gather around.

392
00:23:21,440 --> 00:23:23,000
The new product launches tomorrow.

393
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:25,680
This livestream is absolutely crucial to us.

394
00:23:26,359 --> 00:23:27,960
All your hard work recently

395
00:23:28,079 --> 00:23:29,559
comes down to tomorrow's results.

396
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:31,519
I want everyone on their toes.

397
00:23:31,559 --> 00:23:33,200
We cannot afford any mistakes.

398
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,920
We need to show the market

399
00:23:35,039 --> 00:23:36,599
the true strength of Gufeng Group.

400
00:23:37,039 --> 00:23:38,400
And make this new product

401
00:23:38,559 --> 00:23:40,200
the center of attention in the industry.

402
00:23:40,720 --> 00:23:41,960
Are you all confident?

403
00:23:42,759 --> 00:23:44,079
Yes! Yes! Yes!

404
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:51,759
Good.

405
00:23:51,759 --> 00:23:53,000
Let's get back to work.

406
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,920
Okay, sure.

407
00:23:55,279 --> 00:23:55,880
Let's go.

408
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:02,599
Little Uncle.

409
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:03,960
What brings you here for an inspection?

410
00:24:04,839 --> 00:24:05,880
Afraid I'll ruin the company?

411
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:06,960
Are you worried?

412
00:24:07,440 --> 00:24:08,400
Very impressive.

413
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:10,759
You have the R&D Department well-organized.

414
00:24:11,319 --> 00:24:13,680
And preparations for the New Product Launch are spot on.

415
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,160
I'm not here for anything else.

416
00:24:16,519 --> 00:24:17,519
The winery's been haunted lately,

417
00:24:17,839 --> 00:24:19,000
and everyone is panicked.

418
00:24:19,119 --> 00:24:20,240
I just came to see

419
00:24:20,519 --> 00:24:21,680
what exactly is going on.

420
00:24:24,039 --> 00:24:24,960
Haunted?

421
00:24:26,680 --> 00:24:28,240
I think some people

422
00:24:28,359 --> 00:24:30,079
just have a guilty conscience.

423
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:31,599
No matter what,

424
00:24:34,559 --> 00:24:35,960
seeing your work on this,

425
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,680
you've really set my mind at ease.

426
00:24:47,759 --> 00:24:48,839
In the office,

427
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:50,200
you have to wear your ID badge.

428
00:24:56,319 --> 00:24:57,720
I don't need you worrying about me.

429
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,680
I'm more professional than you.

430
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,400
Besides, you aren't wearing your badge either.

431
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:10,279
I'm your boss.

432
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,039
Do we need to adjust the lights again?

433
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:23,599
See if this works.

434
00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:27,160
How is it?

435
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:27,960
Did you get in touch with her?

436
00:25:27,960 --> 00:25:29,519
Wanniang's phone is still off.

437
00:25:29,599 --> 00:25:31,319
The agency can't reach her either.

438
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:32,720
Director Sang.

439
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:34,720
The fans in the livestream are already rushing us.

440
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,799
There are still a lot of people waiting for Wanniang.

441
00:25:36,799 --> 00:25:38,279
So there are a lot of Wanniang's fans here, right?

442
00:25:38,279 --> 00:25:39,039
Everyone, really,

443
00:25:39,039 --> 00:25:40,799
we won't let you down today.

444
00:25:40,839 --> 00:25:41,400
Today,

445
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,880
we will definitely grant all your wishes.

446
00:25:43,079 --> 00:25:44,279
Contact other streamers right now.

447
00:25:44,279 --> 00:25:45,359
See if anyone can fill in.

448
00:25:45,359 --> 00:25:46,000
Got it.

449
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:47,680
Before Wanniang arrives,

450
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:49,279
let's drop some small giveaways.

451
00:25:49,759 --> 00:25:50,400
How about it?

452
00:25:50,400 --> 00:25:51,319
Are they here yet?

453
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:54,279
Our giveaways are here!

454
00:25:54,279 --> 00:25:54,519
Come on.

455
00:25:54,519 --> 00:25:55,279
Get ready.

456
00:25:55,279 --> 00:25:55,759
Three,

457
00:25:55,759 --> 00:25:56,799
two, one.

458
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:57,799
Post the link.

459
00:25:58,720 --> 00:26:00,200
Make the studio lights a bit brighter.

460
00:26:02,240 --> 00:26:02,880
What's going on?

461
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,400
We can't reach Wanniang.

462
00:26:04,839 --> 00:26:05,599
Everyone is so enthusiastic!

463
00:26:05,599 --> 00:26:06,799
Right now, the most important thing

464
00:26:06,799 --> 00:26:08,440
is to keep the viewer count steady.

465
00:26:08,880 --> 00:26:10,079
Send out a coupon first.

466
00:26:11,039 --> 00:26:11,839
Susu.

467
00:26:12,200 --> 00:26:13,039
Three, two, one.

468
00:26:13,039 --> 00:26:14,279
Send the coupons.

469
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:15,960
Okay, right now,

470
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:17,680
we have ten coupons.

471
00:26:17,680 --> 00:26:18,720
Everyone can grab one.

472
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:19,440
However,

473
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,799
I just contacted other streamers.

474
00:26:20,799 --> 00:26:22,839
The quickest one won't be here for another half hour.

475
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:24,680
Get ready.

476
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:25,359
Ten coupons.

477
00:26:25,400 --> 00:26:26,880
As soon as our Wanniang arrives,

478
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:28,640
we'll drop the giveaways right away.

479
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,200
We'll drop these liquor deals for everyone.

480
00:26:33,799 --> 00:26:35,200
Sang Luo, oh, Sang Luo.

481
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:37,680
Weren't you very confident?

482
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,039
If you mess up the livestream,

483
00:26:40,720 --> 00:26:42,400
let's see how you explain yourself.

484
00:26:44,319 --> 00:26:44,799
Now,

485
00:26:44,799 --> 00:26:46,359
please welcome our mystery guest!
